flowchart LR
  Client[Customers and clients]
  Issuer[JWT issuer / JWKS]
  WAF[AWS WAF rate rules]
  ALB[Application Load Balancer<br/>HTTPS termination]

  subgraph VPC[Private AWS VPC across Availability Zones]
    subgraph ECS[ECS Fargate services — Docker containers]
      API1[API task 1<br/>Fastify / TypeScript]
      API2[API task 2..N<br/>Fastify / TypeScript]
      Worker[Worker tasks<br/>Outbox publisher + Kafka consumer]
    end
    PG[(Amazon RDS PostgreSQL<br/>authoritative inventory<br/>orders + idempotency + outbox)]
    Redis[(Amazon ElastiCache Redis<br/>short TTL product cache)]
    MSK[[Amazon MSK<br/>orders.created.v1]]
    DLQ[[Amazon MSK<br/>orders.created.dlq.v1]]
    Secrets[AWS Secrets Manager]
    CW[CloudWatch logs and alarms]
    OTEL[OpenTelemetry collector / trace exporter]
  end
  Local[Local Prometheus + Grafana]

  Client -->|HTTPS order request| WAF
  WAF --> ALB
  ALB -->|JWT identity passed to API| API1
  ALB -->|JWT identity passed to API| API2
  Issuer -. JWKS signature verification .-> API1
  Issuer -. JWKS signature verification .-> API2
  API1 -->|Synchronous transaction: idempotency, conditional stock update, order, outbox| PG
  API2 -->|Synchronous transaction: idempotency, conditional stock update, order, outbox| PG
  API1 -. cache read / post-commit invalidation .-> Redis
  API2 -. cache read / post-commit invalidation .-> Redis
  Worker -->|Lease with SKIP LOCKED| PG
  Worker -->|Publish after commit, TLS + IAM| MSK
  Worker -->|Mark published after broker ack| PG
  MSK -->|At-least-once delivery| Worker
  Worker -->|Commit status + processed event before offset ack| PG
  Worker -->|Invalid/permanent event after DLQ ack| DLQ
  API1 -. logs .-> CW
  API2 -. logs .-> CW
  Worker -. logs .-> CW
  API1 -. OTLP traces .-> OTEL
  API2 -. OTLP traces .-> OTEL
  Worker -. OTLP traces .-> OTEL
  Local -. scrapes /metrics .-> API1
  Local -. scrapes /metrics .-> Worker
  Secrets -. injected at task start .-> API1
  Secrets -. injected at task start .-> Worker

  classDef db fill:#e8f2ff,stroke:#3572b0,color:#102f4f;
  classDef broker fill:#fff1d6,stroke:#c58b2b,color:#533800;
  classDef app fill:#e9f8ef,stroke:#32945a,color:#123c24;
  class PG,Redis db;
  class MSK,DLQ broker;
  class API1,API2,Worker app;
